WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.380 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 6]

02:03.590 --> 02:05.180
He's Xie Ba's favorite disciple.

02:06.000 --> 02:06.690
Killing him

02:07.310 --> 02:08.500
would be the same as declaring war on the Xie family.

02:10.150 --> 02:11.340
Just tell them that I killed him.

02:11.710 --> 02:12.610
There's nothing to be afraid of.

02:13.470 --> 02:14.450
Xie Ba is declaring war

02:14.470 --> 02:15.450
on the entire Su family.

02:16.910 --> 02:17.980
I'm not afraid that he's declaring war on us.

02:18.630 --> 02:19.850
I'm just worried that he'll be too timid to act.

02:21.360 --> 02:21.730
I'm leaving.

02:21.800 --> 02:22.170
Wait.

02:36.590 --> 02:37.980
We must put on the full act.

02:39.150 --> 02:40.100
Once a person crosses the Blood River,

02:40.910 --> 02:41.820
they shall reach the shore.

02:42.560 --> 02:43.450
Where the shore lies

02:44.150 --> 02:45.060
will no longer be the dark of night.

02:46.240 --> 02:47.380
It will be light.

02:51.080 --> 02:51.610
Someone's coming.

02:52.030 --> 02:52.500
Hurry and leave.

02:59.870 --> 03:00.610
What a shame.

03:01.470 --> 03:02.340
There aren't many interesting people

03:02.430 --> 03:03.500
in the current Xie family.

03:04.000 --> 03:04.940
I guess you could be considered one.

03:06.080 --> 03:07.980
I would've liked to engage you in a fiery battle

03:08.710 --> 03:10.220
if you didn't have

03:10.280 --> 03:11.220
such a sickly complexion.

03:14.520 --> 03:16.260
This is truly unexpected.

03:16.840 --> 03:18.130
The Undertaker of Blood River

03:18.520 --> 03:19.890
is actually very melancholic.

03:21.030 --> 03:21.570
It's you?

03:22.470 --> 03:23.450
The family head of the Mu family,

03:23.960 --> 03:24.780
Mu Zizhe.

03:25.580 --> 03:26.630
[Mu Zizhe, Family Head of Mu family]

03:26.630 --> 03:27.690
You killed Xie Fanhua.

03:28.560 --> 03:30.410
Xie Ba won't let you off.

03:30.960 --> 03:31.660
Even after that,

03:31.680 --> 03:32.270
the members of Blood River

03:32.270 --> 03:33.410
won't let each other off.

03:33.870 --> 03:35.410
Perhaps the so-called Three Families

03:35.560 --> 03:36.660
will only have one family left at the very end.

03:37.190 --> 03:38.100
The sword has been unsheathed.

03:38.560 --> 03:39.660
Why hide its luster?

03:40.560 --> 03:41.610
You're the youngest family head

03:41.630 --> 03:42.820
in the history of the Mu family.

03:43.190 --> 03:44.820
Don't you wish to be

03:45.190 --> 03:45.730
the youngest Patriarch

03:45.800 --> 03:47.260
in all of history?

03:48.280 --> 03:49.220
You're truly

03:49.870 --> 03:51.170
interesting.

03:51.680 --> 03:52.850
I'm here to kill you.

03:54.680 --> 03:55.850
Actually, I already wanted to kill you

03:56.590 --> 03:58.010
when I met you for the first time.

04:16.870 --> 04:17.930
Actually,

04:18.510 --> 04:20.020
your so-called Uncle Zhe,

04:20.630 --> 04:21.660
he's my father.

04:23.040 --> 04:24.290
This is why

04:24.510 --> 04:26.290
I've been inquiring about his whereabouts.

04:27.000 --> 04:27.810
My mother

04:28.120 --> 04:29.250
told me nothing.

04:29.630 --> 04:30.610
She only told me

04:31.070 --> 04:32.660
that he was Kui of Blood River.

04:34.360 --> 04:34.930
That's impossible.

04:36.480 --> 04:37.340
I'm not joking.

04:37.600 --> 04:38.580
Why is it impossible?

04:40.120 --> 04:40.900
The members of Blood River

04:41.800 --> 04:43.020
never marry anyone outside of the sect.

04:43.310 --> 04:44.900
Someone already broke the rule once

04:45.680 --> 04:46.580
and married someone

04:46.630 --> 04:47.410
outside of the sect.

04:48.920 --> 04:49.810
But in the end?

04:50.630 --> 04:51.290
He

04:52.240 --> 04:53.730
and his family

04:54.240 --> 04:55.100
were wiped out.

04:55.920 --> 04:57.370
Uncle Zhe was once Kui.

04:58.000 --> 04:59.100
Even now, he holds a high position

04:59.160 --> 04:59.780
in the Mu family.

05:01.160 --> 05:02.340
It's impossible for him to have a child outside of the sect.

05:03.430 --> 05:04.570
You see,

05:04.630 --> 05:05.980
I was just joking with you.

05:06.160 --> 05:07.730
You actually gave me

05:07.800 --> 05:08.700
an honest and rigid answer.

05:09.000 --> 05:10.220
Isn't Blood River's Kui

05:10.310 --> 05:12.020
the potential candidate to inherit the title of Patriarch?

05:12.240 --> 05:13.220
If so,

05:13.430 --> 05:14.730
why didn't the Patriarch pass the throne to you?

05:15.120 --> 05:16.050
Wouldn't that resolve your crisis?

05:16.390 --> 05:17.410
I'm not a member

05:17.430 --> 05:18.100
of the Blood River's Three Families.

05:19.040 --> 05:20.220
I was born a Nameless.

05:20.800 --> 05:21.580
There were no such individuals

05:22.070 --> 05:23.170
in Blood River

05:23.830 --> 05:25.140
who had inherited the title of Patriarch.

05:25.830 --> 05:26.900
The so-called Nameless

05:27.190 --> 05:28.220
were orphans.

05:28.390 --> 05:30.200
They were only granted a surname after they passed the trial.

05:30.240 --> 05:31.810
They may have joined the Three Families in name,

05:31.830 --> 05:32.540
but in reality,

05:33.630 --> 05:34.400
they're not seen as

05:34.400 --> 05:35.340
true clan members.

05:36.600 --> 05:38.020
Back then, due to special circumstances,

05:38.750 --> 05:39.410
the Patriarch

05:39.750 --> 05:41.100
had no choice but to appoint me as Kui.

05:41.510 --> 05:42.220
All these years,

05:43.190 --> 05:44.580
I always wanted to hand over the position.

05:45.390 --> 05:46.020
But the Patriarch...

05:50.510 --> 05:51.730
The Patriarch didn't allow me to do so.

05:53.160 --> 05:54.540
I wanted to say this since just now.

05:54.920 --> 05:55.700
You're already wounded.

05:56.240 --> 05:57.730
Why are you pretending to be tough in front of me, the miracle physician?

05:58.270 --> 05:58.730
Sorry about that.

06:00.160 --> 06:01.140
I've expended most of my strength and qi

06:01.360 --> 06:02.660
after the fierce battle.

06:04.680 --> 06:05.580
I was truly worried about

06:05.630 --> 06:06.490
the Patriarch.

06:07.240 --> 06:07.980
That's why I pretended to be tough.

06:08.560 --> 06:09.290
What about now?

06:10.510 --> 06:11.340
I can't hold it in anymore.

06:23.600 --> 06:24.780
Let me give you a diagnosis.

06:58.560 --> 06:59.340
The Life-Death Contract?

07:00.270 --> 07:01.460
Only the caster is able to neutralize it

07:01.480 --> 07:02.730
with their inner force.

07:02.800 --> 07:03.220
Miss Bai?

07:05.040 --> 07:06.250
I'll be fine after I treat my wound by regulating my qi.

07:06.720 --> 07:07.250
There's no need to worry.

07:07.480 --> 07:08.460
Regulate your qi to treat your wound?

07:08.870 --> 07:10.020
I think you're just trying to suppress the wound

07:10.160 --> 07:11.460
with your qi.

07:11.920 --> 07:12.540
Physicians like us

07:12.920 --> 07:13.930
hate stupid people like you

07:14.190 --> 07:15.140
who don't cherish their bodies

07:15.310 --> 07:16.460
and lives.

07:19.160 --> 07:19.850
I made a promise

07:20.480 --> 07:21.370
that I would protect the Patriarch.

07:22.750 --> 07:23.580
I also promised

07:24.240 --> 07:25.050
that I would protect you.

07:26.310 --> 07:27.410
Although I didn't promise

07:27.480 --> 07:28.410
that I would protect myself,

07:30.240 --> 07:31.660
I'll at least take care of myself

07:33.070 --> 07:33.930
until you two are doing well.

07:37.630 --> 07:39.140
Su Muyu, the logic expert.

07:40.240 --> 07:41.290
You should rest well.

07:43.800 --> 07:44.250
If not,

07:44.480 --> 07:45.170
you won't have any strength

07:45.240 --> 07:45.780
for the fight later.

07:46.510 --> 07:47.220
I'll be in trouble by then.

08:01.920 --> 08:02.660
This is truly interesting.

08:03.720 --> 08:05.020
The books that were kept in the secret chamber

08:05.070 --> 08:05.780
of Spider's Nest

08:06.630 --> 08:08.410
turned out to be nothing but miscellaneous tales

08:08.510 --> 08:09.540
and popular romances.

08:10.830 --> 08:11.980
Did they put them here because

08:12.070 --> 08:13.220
they were afraid that those who seek shelter here

08:13.600 --> 08:14.610
might be too bored?

08:34.630 --> 08:37.940
What a strange story.

08:41.720 --> 08:42.980
Miss Bai, let's move.

08:45.150 --> 08:45.700
Are you sure

08:45.750 --> 08:46.770
you've rested enough?

08:47.510 --> 08:48.420
Do all members of Blood River

08:48.720 --> 08:49.700
have no regard for their lives?

08:50.080 --> 08:50.940
In Blood River,

08:51.150 --> 08:52.490
I have a senior called Mu Zhaoyang.

08:53.150 --> 08:54.220
He created a set of techniques

08:54.270 --> 08:55.340
that were meant for resting.

08:55.910 --> 08:56.850
It's called the Resting Breath.

08:57.360 --> 08:57.940
The practitioners

08:58.000 --> 08:58.890
only sleep for two hours per day.

08:59.440 --> 09:00.130
After that, we'll find another chance

09:00.240 --> 09:01.060
to rest for a moment.

09:02.030 --> 09:02.850
That would be enough rest for us.

09:03.510 --> 09:03.980
To

09:04.030 --> 09:05.060
medical practitioners like us,

09:05.320 --> 09:06.220
it doesn't make sense at all.

09:06.960 --> 09:08.220
No matter how awesome the Resting Breath

09:08.390 --> 09:09.250
which was created by your senior is,

09:09.270 --> 09:10.060
it doesn't make sense

09:10.440 --> 09:11.220
from a medical perspective.

09:12.120 --> 09:12.650
Perhaps.

09:13.200 --> 09:13.990
But to us,

09:13.990 --> 09:14.700
it proves to be very useful.

09:15.390 --> 09:16.060
After all,

09:16.080 --> 09:17.060
we're always in a race against time.

09:18.240 --> 09:19.180
Sorry for the trouble.

09:20.750 --> 09:21.220
Let's go.

09:33.660 --> 09:36.180
[The Three Families are after Mu Mingce]

09:38.670 --> 09:41.130
The Three Families are in chaos now.

09:44.440 --> 09:46.060
Pitiful members of the Three Families.

09:46.670 --> 09:47.340
They think

09:47.360 --> 09:48.530
that they have a choice.

09:49.390 --> 09:50.610
But they never understood

09:51.200 --> 09:53.340
that the title of Patriarch is just a tool.

09:53.960 --> 09:55.420
The person wielding the tool

09:55.910 --> 09:57.700
has never been them.

09:57.870 --> 09:59.130
The Su family has Su Changhe

09:59.150 --> 10:00.530
and Su Muyu.

10:00.670 --> 10:01.490
There's no way to control them.

10:02.120 --> 10:03.650
Although the Xie family is powerful,

10:03.750 --> 10:05.730
they're reckless. They cannot win the hearts of the people.

10:06.600 --> 10:09.250
The Mu family is cunning and cruel.

10:09.510 --> 10:10.530
However, they're quite weak.

10:11.440 --> 10:13.060
We need a tool that will obey us.

10:13.720 --> 10:16.010
They can fight among themselves.

10:16.600 --> 10:18.890
We can take our time to find one.

10:19.540 --> 10:22.540
[I am incompetent. Please grant me The Death Coffin. — Mu]

10:24.960 --> 10:25.960
That Mu Zizhe

10:25.960 --> 10:27.690
is actually smart enough to ask for help.

10:29.870 --> 10:31.730
If so, we shall grant him The Death Coffin.

10:32.870 --> 10:34.060
It's time for us

10:34.670 --> 10:35.890
to head to the battlefield as well.

10:37.120 --> 10:39.820
Let's find out who the final victor is.

10:40.550 --> 10:42.490
Naturally, everyone except for you can go.

10:43.150 --> 10:44.420
This trip will dispel our misfortune

10:45.000 --> 10:45.890
and absolve us of our sins.

10:46.720 --> 10:48.220
However, it cannot grant us any blessings.

10:48.840 --> 10:50.370
If so, I shall go.

10:51.200 --> 10:51.700
All right.

10:52.270 --> 10:53.100
You shall go.

10:53.960 --> 10:55.300
We've been holed up in here for so long.

10:55.960 --> 10:57.850
It's time for us to take a stroll outside.

11:11.360 --> 11:11.770
Miss Bai.

11:22.910 --> 11:23.850
Please wait here.

11:24.440 --> 11:25.610
I'll head out and inspect the area.

11:26.320 --> 11:26.730
All right.

11:50.390 --> 11:51.220
You're Mu Bai,

11:51.840 --> 11:52.460
young master of the Mu family.

11:53.030 --> 11:53.820
Su Muyu.

11:54.670 --> 11:56.370
I've been waiting for you.

11:59.320 --> 12:00.850
You're smarter than I thought.

12:02.120 --> 12:02.700
Did you forget?

12:03.550 --> 12:05.010
Every array in Spider's Nest

12:05.270 --> 12:07.010
was created by the Mu family.

12:07.510 --> 12:08.850
Although we cannot observe the entire area,

12:09.360 --> 12:10.530
there are some tracks

12:10.600 --> 12:11.370
that we can still go after.

12:12.670 --> 12:14.010
Xuewei relayed the news to me.

12:14.790 --> 12:15.490
She said you and the miracle physician

12:15.510 --> 12:17.060
entered the secret tunnel.

12:17.750 --> 12:19.250
If so, I just need to wait here

12:19.870 --> 12:20.770
and kill the miracle physician when she appears.

12:23.550 --> 12:25.250
By then, the Patriarch

12:25.720 --> 12:27.530
won't be able to survive.

12:28.240 --> 12:28.770
But you?

12:30.870 --> 12:32.580
You're dumber than I thought.

12:33.390 --> 12:34.130
What do you mean?

12:35.000 --> 12:36.420
Since I'm the one appearing before you,

12:37.240 --> 12:38.180
what makes you guys think

12:40.320 --> 12:41.180
that you can defeat me?

12:54.870 --> 12:56.420
Su Muyu, please hang in there.

13:13.670 --> 13:15.060
So, the family head of the Mu family

13:15.320 --> 13:16.180
is only good at

13:16.240 --> 13:17.250
playing sissy tricks, huh?

13:17.720 --> 13:18.850
Dance of the Butterfly, Nine Drives!

13:29.550 --> 13:29.980
Oh no.

13:47.150 --> 13:48.300
I guess this is the full extent

13:48.670 --> 13:49.820
of Blood River's Undertaker, huh?

13:50.120 --> 13:50.890
I already told you

13:50.910 --> 13:52.100
that I hate fighting the Mu family the most.

13:52.840 --> 13:53.850
You guys aren't assassins at all.

13:54.200 --> 13:55.300
You guys are mere tricksters.

13:57.120 --> 13:58.300
Initially, I thought the task I assigned to Uncle Zhe

13:58.360 --> 13:59.250
was a difficult one.

13:59.550 --> 14:01.220
I thought coming to Spider's Nest was a mere formality.

14:01.720 --> 14:02.250
I guess

14:04.000 --> 14:04.650
my calculations were wrong.

14:05.550 --> 14:07.130
I should've taken on his task instead.

14:07.720 --> 14:08.610
During close-quarter combat,

14:08.960 --> 14:10.130
even a top martial arts expert

14:10.150 --> 14:11.340
might commit mistakes.

14:12.000 --> 14:13.010
Therefore, I won't allow you

14:13.510 --> 14:14.650
to come near me.

14:14.720 --> 14:15.580
You do like to talk, don't you?

14:26.750 --> 14:27.300
Did you forget?

14:28.030 --> 14:28.650
I have a friend

14:28.720 --> 14:30.010
who also excels at using Puppet Strings.

14:30.270 --> 14:31.100
His name is Su Muyu.

14:31.240 --> 14:32.820
You may be invincible outside of close-quarter combat,

14:33.120 --> 14:34.460
but that's what we're doing right now.

14:34.630 --> 14:35.980
If so, that means I have the upper hand.

14:49.840 --> 14:51.220
I can only confirm this after testing you.

14:51.600 --> 14:52.610
You don't have enough inner force

14:52.630 --> 14:54.420
to sustain the Eighteen-Sword Array.

14:55.240 --> 14:56.850
Right now, you can only wield one sword.

14:57.510 --> 14:58.890
And, you're seriously wounded.

14:59.480 --> 15:01.130
Do you think you can defeat me?

15:02.000 --> 15:02.730
It seems

15:03.270 --> 15:04.850
I can't enjoy my battle with you today.

15:05.750 --> 15:07.490
I don't think you would dare to engage me

15:09.270 --> 15:10.700
had I not used the Eighteen-Sword Array before this.

15:13.960 --> 15:14.650
It's rare for you

15:14.670 --> 15:15.770
to say something like that.

15:16.360 --> 15:17.460
You were always aloof and nonchalant.

15:17.790 --> 15:18.940
You didn't show any emotions

15:18.960 --> 15:19.770
usually.

15:20.150 --> 15:21.530
It seems you're truly flustered.

15:22.550 --> 15:23.580
You're trying to provoke me

15:23.600 --> 15:24.490
with such a method.

15:24.790 --> 15:25.650
Even so,

15:27.120 --> 15:28.580
you're still no match for me.

15:29.320 --> 15:30.340
Back then, both of us were known as

15:30.340 --> 15:32.240
the youngest top martial experts in our families.

15:33.200 --> 15:34.010
But Mu Zizhe knows

15:34.750 --> 15:36.010
all of your techniques.

15:36.720 --> 15:37.610
However, the techniques I use

15:38.910 --> 15:40.220
are unknown,

15:40.240 --> 15:41.530
even to the family head of the Su family.

15:41.840 --> 15:42.580
Is that so?

15:48.840 --> 15:50.300
Have you seen my Trinity Array before?

15:51.440 --> 15:52.130
I spent a lot of years

15:52.150 --> 15:53.890
to create and improve this array.

15:54.320 --> 15:56.300
All of the techniques and moves are closely knitted.

15:56.720 --> 15:58.060
My foes won't even stand a chance.

15:58.910 --> 15:59.530
Su Muyu,

16:00.000 --> 16:01.100
you'll lose all of that confidence of yours

16:01.120 --> 16:02.650
very soon.

16:17.200 --> 16:17.890
Stop wasting your energy.

16:18.550 --> 16:19.530
They've ingested the Painless Powder,

16:19.550 --> 16:21.250
which the Mu family had invented not long ago.

16:21.600 --> 16:22.180
They know no pain.

16:22.910 --> 16:24.250
They will only obey our commands.

16:45.030 --> 16:47.060
You shall be annihilated in an instant.

16:47.670 --> 16:48.530
An instant

16:49.270 --> 16:50.490
is an eternity for me.

16:53.750 --> 16:54.580
I coated the dagger with poison.

16:59.080 --> 17:00.300
You actually tried to poison

17:00.750 --> 17:01.890
a member of the Mu family?

17:02.670 --> 17:03.300
Naturally, you won't be harmed

17:03.360 --> 17:04.860
by such a weak poison.

17:05.310 --> 17:06.140
But you see...

17:12.790 --> 17:14.380
I won't treat any of you with respect

17:15.200 --> 17:15.810
unless

17:16.270 --> 17:17.420
Su Jinhui comes here personally.

17:17.830 --> 17:19.380
Even if what you said was true,

17:20.070 --> 17:20.870
you have to deal with

17:20.870 --> 17:21.660
the three of us at the same time.

17:22.200 --> 17:23.220
If so, you won't have enough time

17:23.270 --> 17:24.460
to expel the poison in your body.

17:24.920 --> 17:26.090
To you, the poison

17:26.440 --> 17:27.700
might not amount to anything at the moment.

17:27.880 --> 17:29.140
But what if the poison lasts for

17:29.270 --> 17:30.180
two hours?

17:33.350 --> 17:34.380
I'm afraid even a mighty person like you

17:35.000 --> 17:36.290
requires the help of the miracle physician

17:36.310 --> 17:37.010
just to stay alive.

17:38.030 --> 17:38.810
Su Changhe,

17:39.750 --> 17:41.810
you've truly surprised me time and time again.

17:42.200 --> 17:43.980
Farewell, family head.

17:46.830 --> 17:47.330
How was it?

17:48.480 --> 17:49.490
I assume you two

17:49.510 --> 17:50.380
had witnessed my performance.

17:51.310 --> 17:53.140
I truly gave it my all

17:53.350 --> 17:54.290
this time around.

17:55.750 --> 17:57.090
I almost died, you know?

17:57.920 --> 17:59.770
Remember to flatter me

17:59.920 --> 18:01.380
in front of the family head, okay?

18:01.880 --> 18:03.290
With Cutting Embrace, your main offense weapon,

18:03.550 --> 18:05.180
Falling Autumn, your main defense weapon,

18:06.000 --> 18:07.940
and White-Sleeve Sword, your main hidden weapon,

18:08.160 --> 18:09.490
your techniques are almost flawless.

18:09.960 --> 18:11.290
You do live up to your reputation as the Umbrella Ghost.

18:11.960 --> 18:12.770
You already saw through my sword arrays

18:12.830 --> 18:14.380
right after a few blows.

18:14.790 --> 18:15.770
But you forgot something.

18:16.110 --> 18:17.180
There's another me out there.

18:17.640 --> 18:18.530
I'm observing your every move

18:18.960 --> 18:20.770
outside the array.

18:21.270 --> 18:22.010
Those outside of the situation

18:22.400 --> 18:23.860
always see clearer.

18:25.000 --> 18:26.660
Mu Wusheng, target the Kan Gate in the southeast.

18:26.880 --> 18:28.380
Mu Wuheng, target the Xiu Gate in the north.

18:28.750 --> 18:30.460
Mu Wufeng, target his qi center.

19:21.350 --> 19:22.730
So what if you've invented the Trinity Array?

19:23.070 --> 19:24.180
Arrays are rigid

19:24.400 --> 19:25.770
while your foes aren't.

19:26.240 --> 19:27.530
No matter how meticulous an array is,

19:28.640 --> 19:29.940
there's always a way to dispel it.

19:30.350 --> 19:30.980
How did you find a way

19:31.030 --> 19:32.090
to dispel it

19:32.110 --> 19:33.180
in such a short period?

19:33.960 --> 19:34.490
I come from a place

19:34.510 --> 19:36.050
famed for its swordsmanship.

19:36.680 --> 19:37.220
Over there,

19:37.590 --> 19:38.380
there are people

19:38.400 --> 19:39.730
who study and invent swordsmanship.

19:40.310 --> 19:41.180
There are also some

19:41.240 --> 19:42.330
who focus on defeating the ways of the sword.

19:42.960 --> 19:44.180
My father once said this before.

19:45.510 --> 19:46.490
If one isn't the Sword Deity,

19:48.030 --> 19:48.940
one doesn't have the right

19:49.720 --> 19:50.730
to mention the word "sword"

19:50.830 --> 19:51.860
in front of him.

19:52.640 --> 19:53.570
The No-Sword City?

19:54.510 --> 19:56.380
You actually came from there?

19:56.830 --> 19:58.090
I didn't even use the Eighteen-Sword Array,

19:59.590 --> 20:00.380
and you've already lost to me.

20:01.400 --> 20:02.140
Did you think

20:02.750 --> 20:04.290
that I only brought three of them with me?

20:19.510 --> 20:20.220
The blossom side's up.

20:20.830 --> 20:21.530
Lucky.

20:21.960 --> 20:22.570
Qingyang.

20:23.030 --> 20:24.220
You're late.

20:24.720 --> 20:25.620
Sorry about that.

20:25.830 --> 20:26.620
I couldn't allow Xuewei

20:26.790 --> 20:27.860
to witness this battle.

20:28.030 --> 20:28.900
If not,

20:29.030 --> 20:29.620
she would definitely

20:29.640 --> 20:30.490
defend Su Muyu with her life.

20:32.000 --> 20:32.770
It took me a lot of effort

20:32.880 --> 20:34.010
to send her elsewhere.

20:36.350 --> 20:36.860
Lord Kui.

20:37.680 --> 20:38.420
We meet again.

20:39.110 --> 20:39.860
Qingyang.

20:40.960 --> 20:41.810
Five ghosts from the Mu family,

20:42.400 --> 20:43.380
Mu Bai,

20:43.510 --> 20:44.330
and Mu Qingyang, huh?

20:45.070 --> 20:45.700
It seems my only choice

20:45.880 --> 20:47.090
is to risk it all.

20:48.000 --> 20:48.660
Miss Bai,

20:49.270 --> 20:50.140
I hope this will help you

20:50.350 --> 20:51.700
to escape.

21:27.440 --> 21:28.140
Su Muyu.

21:28.750 --> 21:29.730
You won't be able

21:30.160 --> 21:31.770
to withstand this array for long.

21:35.610 --> 21:36.340
Darn it.

21:36.960 --> 21:38.250
That darned fool, Su Changhe.

21:38.790 --> 21:39.730
What a let-down.

21:41.070 --> 21:41.770
Uncle Zhe, you're here.

21:44.830 --> 21:45.620
That brat

21:46.030 --> 21:47.420
merely put on a show at Spider's Nest.

21:47.720 --> 21:48.770
He told me to keep guard over here.

21:49.680 --> 21:50.660
And, I did find my target.

21:51.350 --> 21:52.730
But the seven ghosts of the Mu family are here as well.

21:53.240 --> 21:54.900
Uncle Zhe, what do you mean by that?

21:55.440 --> 21:56.460
Did I say you could speak?

21:59.350 --> 21:59.960
You...

22:00.590 --> 22:01.730
Uncle Zhe, you still like

22:01.750 --> 22:03.490
to pretend as if you're someone powerful.

22:03.880 --> 22:04.860
Do I even need to do that?

22:05.200 --> 22:06.290
I'm powerful from the start.

22:06.920 --> 22:08.090
Uncle Zhe, what do you plan to do next?

22:08.750 --> 22:09.570
I plan

22:09.880 --> 22:10.810
to come up with a way

22:10.830 --> 22:12.420
to not kill you and complete my task at the same time.

22:14.070 --> 22:15.180
I'm afraid that would be quite difficult.

22:16.240 --> 22:17.010
Indeed.

22:19.440 --> 22:20.620
But you see,

22:21.000 --> 22:22.810
we've been through the muck together after all.

22:23.960 --> 22:25.330
You mean hardships.

22:26.590 --> 22:27.220
That's right.

22:28.510 --> 22:29.730
That's why we need to be educated.

22:31.590 --> 22:32.220
What about this?

22:32.750 --> 22:33.620
Let's join hands

22:34.160 --> 22:35.700
and deal with the ghosts for now.

22:36.200 --> 22:36.810
After that,

22:36.880 --> 22:37.660
we can settle

22:37.680 --> 22:38.330
our own family affairs.

22:46.160 --> 22:47.660
It seems at least one of them

22:47.920 --> 22:49.090
is quite powerful.

22:50.310 --> 22:51.220
Uncle Zhe, I've long heard of your name.

22:52.070 --> 22:52.900
Even if I'm not,

22:53.550 --> 22:54.460
I have to pretend to be powerful.

22:57.680 --> 22:58.810
That'll make things difficult for me, you know?

23:01.070 --> 23:01.570
What do you think?

23:02.160 --> 23:02.860
Uncle Zhe, I'm willing

23:03.510 --> 23:04.490
to fend off our foes together with you.

23:24.680 --> 23:25.380
Sorry about this.

23:26.030 --> 23:26.620
Muyu.

23:43.160 --> 23:43.810
Miracle physician,

23:44.240 --> 23:45.090
we meet again.

23:45.640 --> 23:46.620
I, Su Zhe of the Su family,

23:47.160 --> 23:48.090
am here to send the miracle physician to the afterlife

23:48.680 --> 23:50.010
under the family head's order.

23:59.400 --> 24:00.250
The Phantom Step, huh?

24:01.030 --> 24:01.660
You scum.

24:04.000 --> 24:05.090
Who exactly are you?

24:06.160 --> 24:06.660
Me?

24:07.790 --> 24:08.860
I'm Bai Hehuai,

24:09.310 --> 24:10.380
the miracle physician of the Medicine King Valley.

24:11.480 --> 24:12.700
Does your mother have the surname Wen?

24:15.030 --> 24:16.420
The Phantom Step that you used

24:17.030 --> 24:17.900
was the one I had modified.

24:18.750 --> 24:19.460
And,

24:19.480 --> 24:20.620
I only taught her the technique alone.

24:20.960 --> 24:21.420
You're right.

24:22.030 --> 24:22.770
So what?

24:24.830 --> 24:25.380
Su Zhe,

24:26.240 --> 24:27.070
what's the relationship

24:27.070 --> 24:28.180
between you and the miracle physician?

24:31.400 --> 24:32.090
That's none of your business.

24:32.790 --> 24:33.250
Fine.

24:33.790 --> 24:34.490
I'll stay out of it.

24:35.440 --> 24:35.860
Come.

24:36.640 --> 24:37.090
Do it!

24:38.030 --> 24:39.090
All of you, scram!

24:43.100 --> 24:43.920
Su Zhe,

24:43.960 --> 24:44.900
whose side are you on?

24:48.270 --> 24:49.290
Is your mother's name

24:49.830 --> 24:50.980
Wen Luojin?

24:51.400 --> 24:52.290
Is her nickname He?

24:53.400 --> 24:53.980
That's right.

24:55.350 --> 24:56.090
If so, you must be...

25:01.590 --> 25:02.720
I haven't had the chance

25:02.720 --> 25:03.730
to name you yet.

25:05.510 --> 25:06.620
So, your name is...

25:08.480 --> 25:09.810
Hehuai is the name my mother gave me.

25:10.640 --> 25:11.660
It means "White cranes fly south,

25:12.270 --> 25:13.250
gazing across the Huai River."

25:17.070 --> 25:18.420
White cranes fly south, huh?

25:22.960 --> 25:24.330
What an excellent name.

25:27.310 --> 25:28.980
Your mother is truly gifted

25:29.110 --> 25:30.140
when it comes to naming people.

25:31.550 --> 25:32.180
Do you mean like the time

25:32.920 --> 25:33.660
she called you Scum?

25:35.720 --> 25:36.220
That's right.

25:36.920 --> 25:37.660
Just like the time she called me Scum.

25:39.240 --> 25:40.700
So, what she said was true all along.

25:52.350 --> 25:53.180
Are you injured?

25:55.790 --> 25:56.290
Su Zhe,

25:56.880 --> 25:58.940
how dare you marry someone outside of our clan?

26:01.200 --> 26:01.770
So what if I did?

26:03.640 --> 26:04.730
You've broken the rules of our clan.

26:05.240 --> 26:06.140
Both you and this illegitimate child

26:06.480 --> 26:07.050
deserve to die!

26:08.480 --> 26:08.980
Nonsense.

26:09.680 --> 26:10.720
Blood River is trying

26:10.750 --> 26:11.860
to get rid of the Patriarch now.

26:12.310 --> 26:13.980
Now, you want to talk about the rules?

26:15.000 --> 26:16.010
I just married

26:16.030 --> 26:16.980
a beautiful woman outside of the clan

26:17.110 --> 26:18.250
and got myself a precious daughter.

26:18.550 --> 26:19.180
And now, you're saying

26:19.200 --> 26:20.220
that I broke the rules?

26:20.480 --> 26:20.980
What about you, then?

26:21.480 --> 26:22.490
You tried to kill the Patriarch.

26:23.070 --> 26:24.180
Executing you is too lenient

26:24.310 --> 26:24.900
of a punishment for you.

26:25.510 --> 26:25.900
You!

26:28.070 --> 26:28.530
Muyu.

26:29.400 --> 26:30.050
I never expected

26:30.070 --> 26:31.180
to encounter my daughter here.

26:31.440 --> 26:31.980
Do me a favor.

26:32.310 --> 26:33.620
I wish to speak with my daughter.

26:34.550 --> 26:35.420
I don't want any outsiders to bother us.

26:35.790 --> 26:36.290
Understood.

26:46.920 --> 26:48.900
This is truly a surprising reunion.

26:50.720 --> 26:51.770
If only

26:51.790 --> 26:52.860
your mother were here.

26:53.270 --> 26:54.250
What? Can't I be here instead of my mother?

26:54.790 --> 26:55.460
Of course you can.

26:56.200 --> 26:56.940
It's just

26:57.070 --> 26:58.380
that it would be better if my wife were here.

26:58.680 --> 26:59.380
No matter how good your wife was,

27:00.070 --> 27:00.490
you never

27:00.510 --> 27:01.330
returned home anyway.

27:02.790 --> 27:03.380
I didn't return home

27:03.400 --> 27:04.460
for the sake of you guys.

27:05.110 --> 27:06.420
I reviewed the Patriarch's memory.

27:07.200 --> 27:08.330
He gave you freedom.

27:10.000 --> 27:10.490
Yeah.

27:11.270 --> 27:12.700
He removed my position as Kui

27:13.400 --> 27:14.090
and granted me freedom.

27:15.440 --> 27:17.140
After that, I traveled to the Wen Residence happily.

27:17.790 --> 27:18.700
But your mother

27:19.160 --> 27:20.700
still contracted a terminal disease.

27:21.880 --> 27:22.620
Your grandfather

27:22.640 --> 27:23.490
kicked me out of the family.

27:24.030 --> 27:24.770
He said

27:25.240 --> 27:26.620
that he would kill me

27:26.790 --> 27:27.660
if I approached you

27:28.000 --> 27:28.810
or the Wen family.

27:29.160 --> 27:29.570
Of course,

27:29.920 --> 27:30.700
I wasn't afraid of him.

27:31.240 --> 27:32.330
But after I gave it some thought,

27:32.880 --> 27:34.180
I realized that I would only

27:34.880 --> 27:35.730
put you in danger

27:35.750 --> 27:36.730
if I stayed beside you.

27:39.680 --> 27:40.620
Scum.

27:41.790 --> 27:42.460
Good girl.

27:43.000 --> 27:44.420
Scum is what your mother used to call me.

27:44.680 --> 27:46.180
You have to call me your father somehow.

27:46.640 --> 27:47.090
Scummy Father.

27:47.960 --> 27:48.460
Fine, fine.

27:49.310 --> 27:50.010
I suppose that'll do.

27:50.480 --> 27:51.510
Will you still take my life?

27:52.550 --> 27:54.150
It was just a misunderstanding.

27:54.240 --> 27:54.570
And now,

27:54.880 --> 27:56.040
the misunderstanding has been resolved.

28:02.160 --> 28:02.980
Those who dare

28:03.020 --> 28:03.830
to approach my daughter

28:04.640 --> 28:05.530
will be killed immediately.

28:07.830 --> 28:08.330
Uncle Zhe.

28:08.960 --> 28:09.810
Don't you think your change of attitude

28:09.880 --> 28:10.660
is too immediate?

28:11.640 --> 28:12.770
Hey, we're a family.

28:13.110 --> 28:14.180
Stop being so courteous.

28:15.030 --> 28:15.460
Young Master,

28:16.160 --> 28:16.730
it appears

28:17.160 --> 28:17.940
that they're trying to join hands.

28:18.750 --> 28:19.900
Since the Su family wants a fight,

28:20.590 --> 28:21.620
we'll give it to them.

28:22.110 --> 28:22.620
How could we back off

28:22.680 --> 28:23.570
in front of them?

28:24.000 --> 28:24.700
Su Zhe

28:24.920 --> 28:26.420
was the strongest member of the Su family.

28:27.070 --> 28:28.220
Young fellow of the Mu family,

28:28.440 --> 28:29.530
you're wrong about something.

28:30.550 --> 28:31.090
What do you mean?

28:31.830 --> 28:32.660
I'm still

28:33.200 --> 28:34.490
the strongest member of the family.

28:48.920 --> 28:49.900
What kind of sinister technique is this?

28:50.480 --> 28:51.620
That's the Mu family's Hollow Ghost Array.

28:52.110 --> 28:52.570
Please be careful.

28:53.310 --> 28:54.330
How dare they use such a sinister technique

28:54.880 --> 28:56.330
when I have the Demon-Taming Staff?

28:56.400 --> 28:56.980
Such audacity.

29:17.920 --> 29:18.250
Let's go!

29:26.480 --> 29:27.290
I dispelled their array

29:27.720 --> 29:28.460
before they could set it up.

29:33.240 --> 29:33.700
Uncle Zhe,

29:34.200 --> 29:34.730
how come none of us

29:34.790 --> 29:35.810
noticed how powerful you were

29:36.480 --> 29:37.140
when we were dealing with

29:37.160 --> 29:37.900
the Demonic Sect back then?

29:39.830 --> 29:41.620
My daughter is here, you know?

29:41.790 --> 29:42.770
Of course I have to show off a little bit.

29:43.590 --> 29:44.660
It's not like I'm getting paid

29:44.960 --> 29:45.810
for dealing with the Demonic Sect.

29:46.030 --> 29:47.010
There's no need to go overboard.

29:48.030 --> 29:49.180
Uncle Zhe, you still went easy on them.

29:50.750 --> 29:51.620
Those two brats

29:51.960 --> 29:52.860
are quite capable.

29:53.200 --> 29:53.940
They managed to escape.

29:54.590 --> 29:55.620
So,

29:56.030 --> 29:57.290
since you two have been reunited,

29:57.720 --> 29:58.900
should I go somewhere else

29:59.550 --> 30:00.140
and give you two some time?

30:01.310 --> 30:02.250
No need for that.

30:02.680 --> 30:04.090
You can stand here.

30:04.750 --> 30:05.620
If not, it'll be very awkward.

30:08.160 --> 30:09.530
During such a critical moment,

30:09.830 --> 30:10.620
I reunited with my daughter,

30:10.960 --> 30:12.290
which was supposed to be a touching scene.

30:12.880 --> 30:13.660
But you see,

30:13.830 --> 30:14.900
I'm not very used to it.

30:16.110 --> 30:17.050
We can talk while we travel, then.

30:17.510 --> 30:18.180
We don't have much time left.

30:18.600 --> 30:19.840
We have to return to Spider's Nest as soon as possible.

30:20.590 --> 30:21.220
- All right. - All right.

30:32.750 --> 30:33.620
Su Zhe

30:34.110 --> 30:35.730
is too powerful to be true.

30:36.400 --> 30:37.050
He was once

30:37.790 --> 30:39.420
one step away from being

30:39.880 --> 30:41.250
the Patriarch after all.

30:41.720 --> 30:42.570
Once I return, I'll report this

30:42.590 --> 30:43.250
to Father immediately.

30:44.070 --> 30:44.570
This time,

30:45.920 --> 30:47.660
not only will we kill the Patriarch,

30:48.590 --> 30:49.660
but we'll also get rid of

30:50.200 --> 30:51.460
the Su family once and for all.

30:51.830 --> 30:52.620
That's right.

30:54.830 --> 30:55.860
You have a point.

30:57.880 --> 30:58.770
However,

30:59.720 --> 31:01.290
I think we still lack a convincing reason

31:01.960 --> 31:03.620
to steel the family head's resolve

31:04.550 --> 31:05.700
of dealing with

31:06.200 --> 31:07.530
the Su family.

31:08.240 --> 31:08.900
What do we need?

31:10.880 --> 31:11.810
Your death.

31:17.750 --> 31:18.460
Now,

31:19.160 --> 31:21.220
all of the traps here have been disarmed.

31:22.160 --> 31:24.250
Even the Spider Web, which was meant to ward off foes, was destroyed.

31:25.270 --> 31:26.490
Now, I can only depend on you all

31:26.920 --> 31:28.050
to defend the place.

31:34.640 --> 31:35.860
- Sir. - Sir.

31:36.480 --> 31:37.290
Good job, everyone.

31:41.550 --> 31:42.290
Su Zhe?

31:44.480 --> 31:44.860
Sir.

31:45.310 --> 31:45.730
Have you

31:45.830 --> 31:46.490
betrayed us?

31:48.070 --> 31:48.700
How could you guys

31:48.720 --> 31:49.490
have no confidence in me?

31:50.240 --> 31:51.490
Do you guys think I'll defect to our enemies' side

31:51.880 --> 31:52.980
while you guys are still keeping guard here?

31:56.830 --> 31:57.290
Sir,

31:57.720 --> 31:58.770
back then, joining the Spider's Nest

31:59.030 --> 32:00.000
was a top honor.

32:00.510 --> 32:01.050
But now,

32:01.550 --> 32:03.250
our own clan members are after us.

32:03.830 --> 32:05.730
It's as if we're sinners.

32:06.510 --> 32:07.290
They're the ones at fault here.

32:08.510 --> 32:09.090
It's not you guys.

32:11.440 --> 32:12.570
Uncle Zhe is here to aid us.

32:13.480 --> 32:14.380
As the previous Kui,

32:15.750 --> 32:16.900
he's willing to be on our side.

32:17.920 --> 32:18.810
Brat,

32:19.160 --> 32:20.330
stop slapping labels on me.

32:24.240 --> 32:25.220
However,

32:25.640 --> 32:26.980
quelling the internal dispute of Blood River

32:27.550 --> 32:28.810
is indeed a part of my duties.

32:29.880 --> 32:30.330
Sir,

32:31.070 --> 32:31.900
Miss Bai has already found a way

32:32.160 --> 32:33.570
to cure the Patriarch of his condition.

32:34.200 --> 32:35.140
If that's the case,

32:35.920 --> 32:37.420
please tell her to perform the treatment.

32:38.200 --> 32:38.730
However,

32:39.510 --> 32:40.290
I cannot perform

32:40.790 --> 32:41.330
the treatment.

32:42.720 --> 32:43.460
But why?

32:46.510 --> 32:47.250
If I perform it,

32:48.030 --> 32:48.810
I will die.

32:52.000 --> 32:52.530
That won't do.

32:54.440 --> 32:54.940
Miracle physician.

32:58.000 --> 32:58.570
Is your death

32:59.440 --> 33:00.770
the only condition?

33:01.510 --> 33:02.380
Or can other people

33:03.720 --> 33:05.290
die on your behalf?

33:23.350 --> 33:24.180
After your mother's passing,

33:24.960 --> 33:26.460
I visited the Wen family in secret a few times.

33:27.070 --> 33:28.010
I realized that you were missing.

33:28.920 --> 33:29.800
I never expected you

33:30.200 --> 33:31.330
to travel to the Medicine King Valley

33:31.330 --> 33:31.980
just to study medicine.

33:33.000 --> 33:34.180
So, you returned to our residence

33:34.200 --> 33:34.770
plenty of times.

33:36.440 --> 33:37.900
Have you never met Mother even once?

33:38.590 --> 33:39.010
That's not true.

33:40.400 --> 33:41.620
I was able to see her

33:42.270 --> 33:43.090
on the night before her passing.

33:43.720 --> 33:44.220
What?

33:46.440 --> 33:47.090
That night, your grandfather

33:47.110 --> 33:48.220
no longer obstructed me from seeing her.

33:49.160 --> 33:50.290
He brought me to her side.

33:53.750 --> 33:55.090
She died in my arms.

34:00.350 --> 34:01.220
You were still young back then.

34:02.000 --> 34:03.460
You were sleeping on the bed beside hers.

34:04.030 --> 34:04.620
You slept soundly.

34:05.270 --> 34:06.330
You slept until the next day.

34:08.190 --> 34:10.090
But according to my grandfather,

34:10.800 --> 34:12.740
you're a heartless person.

34:13.030 --> 34:14.690
You deceived my mother's feelings.

34:16.440 --> 34:17.820
That old fool...

34:21.030 --> 34:22.420
But according to my mother,

34:22.960 --> 34:23.980
you're not someone like that.

34:27.070 --> 34:27.740
That's why

34:29.070 --> 34:29.900
I wanted to find you

34:30.320 --> 34:31.170
and ask you about it personally.

34:33.320 --> 34:34.460
I was young back then.

34:35.000 --> 34:35.940
I thought love

34:36.030 --> 34:36.820
was above all else.

34:37.800 --> 34:38.610
With my capabilities,

34:39.150 --> 34:40.860
I was sure I could defy the rules of Blood River.

34:42.760 --> 34:43.640
Initially, I almost coerced them

34:43.640 --> 34:44.460
into agreeing with my conditions.

34:45.480 --> 34:46.690
But when they heard

34:47.030 --> 34:49.050
that the lady was the precious daughter of the Wen family,

34:49.670 --> 34:50.610
even the Patriarch

34:50.880 --> 34:51.820
was unwilling to help me out.

34:55.630 --> 34:56.740
In the end, I failed.

34:57.440 --> 34:58.010
Scummy Father,

34:58.960 --> 35:00.090
will you come with me?

35:01.960 --> 35:02.900
Of course.

35:03.510 --> 35:05.170
Wherever my daughter goes, I'll follow.

35:05.670 --> 35:07.490
If you say yes, I won't say no.

35:08.230 --> 35:09.690
But aren't you defying the rules of Blood River

35:09.690 --> 35:10.570
by doing so?

35:13.320 --> 35:14.980
The world is in chaos now.

35:15.400 --> 35:16.570
No one is going by the books.

35:17.360 --> 35:18.530
If so, it's every man for himself.

35:19.320 --> 35:19.690
All right.

35:20.360 --> 35:21.690
Come with me to the south

35:22.070 --> 35:23.260
once I'm done treating the Patriarch.

35:25.230 --> 35:26.210
Sure,

35:26.960 --> 35:27.610
but why?

35:28.840 --> 35:29.380
My girl,

35:29.800 --> 35:31.300
you're doing everything you can

35:31.440 --> 35:32.460
to treat the Patriarch.

35:33.550 --> 35:34.420
Are you doing it because

35:34.510 --> 35:35.490
you fell for Su Muyu?

35:40.510 --> 35:41.650
People say that Muyu

35:41.670 --> 35:42.740
is the best-looking member of Blood River

35:42.760 --> 35:43.780
in the past 100 years.

35:44.320 --> 35:45.780
It seems that wasn't just a rumor.

35:47.400 --> 35:48.010
However,

35:48.550 --> 35:49.740
it isn't a good thing for a girl

35:50.230 --> 35:51.420
to fall for a member of Blood River.

35:52.480 --> 35:53.570
Scummy Father,

35:54.190 --> 35:55.130
why are you insulting yourself as well?

35:57.190 --> 35:58.130
If not, why are you doing this, then?

35:59.440 --> 36:01.010
Of course it's because

36:01.710 --> 36:02.380
I get paid for it.

36:05.230 --> 36:06.570
Why did you take after your mother in that regard?

36:07.320 --> 36:08.690
Money is the most important thing, you know?

36:09.590 --> 36:10.050
However,

36:10.550 --> 36:11.260
we should only leave

36:11.320 --> 36:12.420
after the Patriarch has been cured.

36:13.280 --> 36:13.650
If not,

36:14.030 --> 36:14.860
all of my previous efforts

36:15.030 --> 36:16.090
will go down the drain.

36:17.590 --> 36:18.130
And,

36:18.800 --> 36:19.690
since Blood River

36:19.760 --> 36:20.860
is indebted to us,

36:21.150 --> 36:22.900
I think they won't stop us from leaving.

36:23.480 --> 36:24.050
I suppose they won't stop us

36:24.110 --> 36:24.780
from getting reunited.

36:34.000 --> 36:34.340
Sir,

36:34.880 --> 36:35.780
back then, joining Spider's Nest

36:36.150 --> 36:37.010
was a top honor.

36:37.590 --> 36:38.090
But now,

36:38.630 --> 36:40.480
our own clan members are after us.

36:40.920 --> 36:42.740
It's as if we're sinners.

36:45.230 --> 36:46.170
Were my principles

36:46.920 --> 36:48.210
the reasons why

36:48.840 --> 36:50.610
my followers became wandering vagabonds

36:51.190 --> 36:52.000
without anyone to depend on

36:52.000 --> 36:53.300
in Blood River?

36:57.960 --> 36:58.460
Lord Kui.

36:59.710 --> 37:00.170
Si the Snake.

37:01.190 --> 37:02.460
Lord Kui, sorry for interrupting your personal time.

37:02.960 --> 37:04.400
Miss Bai and Uncle Zhe were having a discussion.

37:04.710 --> 37:05.860
They wanted me to deliver the medicine to you.

37:11.800 --> 37:12.420
Si the Snake,

37:13.760 --> 37:14.650
don't leave yet.

37:17.670 --> 37:19.050
Lord Kui, do you have any other instructions?

37:21.030 --> 37:22.260
I suppose you were the newest member

37:23.510 --> 37:24.490
to join

37:24.590 --> 37:25.300
Spider's Nest, right?

37:30.760 --> 37:31.780
The previous Si the Snake

37:31.960 --> 37:33.380
died from a sudden illness a year ago.

37:34.440 --> 37:35.940
Lord Kui, you chose me

37:35.960 --> 37:36.690
among the other members.

37:38.360 --> 37:38.860
That's right.

37:40.710 --> 37:41.980
You wouldn't be roped into this conflict

37:43.190 --> 37:44.420
had I not chosen you

37:44.480 --> 37:45.460
back then.

37:48.000 --> 37:48.940
You were implicated because of me.

37:53.480 --> 37:54.010
Lord Kui,

37:55.280 --> 37:56.460
may I ask you a question?

37:58.630 --> 37:59.090
Go ahead.

38:00.110 --> 38:00.980
Is Blood River

38:01.880 --> 38:02.610
an organization filled with crooks?

38:10.440 --> 38:12.340
We kill for money, and we don't ask questions.

38:13.070 --> 38:14.380
People turn pale

38:14.480 --> 38:15.340
when they hear our name.

38:16.280 --> 38:17.210
We've accumulated countless feuds and grudges

38:17.630 --> 38:18.940
in the martial world and the imperial court.

38:19.670 --> 38:20.450
And, plenty of people

38:20.450 --> 38:21.930
want to get rid of us.

38:23.590 --> 38:24.690
So, are we crooks?

38:26.030 --> 38:27.210
Of course we are.

38:32.670 --> 38:34.650
But no one is born a willing crook.

38:37.150 --> 38:38.570
I was born in Blood River's Mu family.

38:39.590 --> 38:40.690
I've been learning how to kill people

38:40.760 --> 38:42.210
ever since I could remember things.

38:43.150 --> 38:44.340
We had no other choice

38:45.360 --> 38:46.980
ever since we were born.

38:49.030 --> 38:50.210
I thought joining Spider's Nest

38:50.920 --> 38:52.570
was just an extension of this nightmare.

38:53.670 --> 38:54.860
That was until I met you, Lord Kui.

38:56.320 --> 38:58.050
You were the first person I met in Blood River

38:58.760 --> 38:59.980
who harbored kind thoughts

39:00.360 --> 39:01.900
and retained hope in your heart.

39:03.230 --> 39:04.460
You were the one who told us

39:04.960 --> 39:05.860
that joining Spider's Nest

39:06.550 --> 39:08.090
could turn us into a protective shield

39:08.550 --> 39:09.780
from a killing tool.

39:11.070 --> 39:12.010
If so, I'm willing to die

39:12.840 --> 39:14.210
for the sake of protecting others.

39:16.190 --> 39:16.860
Thank you.

39:17.880 --> 39:19.420
But Lord Kui, you're the one I wish to protect,

39:19.960 --> 39:20.860
not the Patriarch.

39:25.230 --> 39:26.650
I think it's the same for Chen the Dragon and the rest.

39:27.840 --> 39:29.490
No one is born a willing crook.

39:31.110 --> 39:32.650
Even if one does turn into a crook,

39:33.880 --> 39:36.090
in our hearts, we still admire and long for

39:36.480 --> 39:37.900
kind individuals.

39:39.670 --> 39:40.260
Lord Kui,

39:41.960 --> 39:42.690
if Blood River

39:42.710 --> 39:44.050
represents the endless night,

39:45.230 --> 39:46.820
you're the first ray of light

39:48.280 --> 39:49.300
that I've encountered.

39:53.000 --> 39:53.740
Lord Kui,

39:54.590 --> 39:55.980
if the Patriarch dies,

39:58.320 --> 39:59.530
please wield the Dormant Dragon Sword

39:59.880 --> 40:01.090
and inherit the title of Patriarch.

40:10.880 --> 40:13.340
Lord Kui, please wield the Dormant Dragon Sword

40:13.510 --> 40:15.380
and inherit the title of Patriarch.

40:18.340 --> 40:21.820
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

40:21.860 --> 40:25.740
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

40:27.580 --> 40:31.060
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

40:31.100 --> 40:34.940
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

40:36.940 --> 40:40.220
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

40:40.340 --> 40:42.420
♪Still I can't let go♪

40:42.580 --> 40:46.020
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

40:46.500 --> 40:48.700
♪My heart no longer my own♪

40:48.820 --> 40:53.820
♪No one can escape from love♪

41:10.420 --> 41:14.140
♪How many hidden feelings♪

41:14.260 --> 41:18.340
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

41:19.580 --> 41:23.460
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

41:23.580 --> 41:27.820
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

41:28.940 --> 41:31.820
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

41:31.900 --> 41:36.140
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

41:38.420 --> 41:42.420
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

41:42.460 --> 41:45.900
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

41:47.420 --> 41:50.860
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

41:50.940 --> 41:54.740
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

41:56.660 --> 42:00.100
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

